Licensed under either of the Apache License, Version 2.0 or the MIT license, at your option.

This package includes code derived from soispoke/minimal-shielded-pool
(https://github.com/soispoke/minimal-shielded-pool, commit eb1bc0e7e19dfabc1d4009119beb9aaa04c61e07),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

  src/rlp.ts, src/frames.ts, src/ecdsa.ts and src/bytes.ts port that project's
  src/frametx.ts, src/bytes.ts and the signTransaction helper of src/spend.ts
  (RLP, the EIP-8141 frame-transaction envelope and signature hash, the
  execution-cap and max-gas accounting, and secp256k1 signing).

  Modifications: ARBITRARY signature entries are encoded with an empty signer, as
  EIP-8141 requires; a full RLP and frame-transaction decoder was added; the
  input-parsing helpers were reduced and renamed; the code was restructured into
  separate modules.

That project in turn notes that its src/frametx.ts derives from
lambdaclass/ethrex's reference type-0x06 frame-transaction encoder
(Apache-2.0 / MIT).
